{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"19291","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:19291","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_75297","characterName":"ヴィオ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"75297","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"249447"},{"characterId":"75297","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41268"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ヴィオ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"15"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0729"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"152"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"46"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格开朗又很会作家事的女孩，比起日常三餐，更喜欢胡萝卜。虽然双亲想要搬去邻国的大都市，不过她却非常反对，原因就是城市里胡萝卜太少了（这得有多喜欢啊！）。后来跟双亲作下在父母去ヴォルケラント王国建立基业的三年内如果能够维持自己的店的话，就可以在村子里继续生活的条件，并跟哥哥一起留在村子里生活。利用旅行中的炼金术士爱赛尔教给她的炼金术来经营自己的商店，同时发展壮大村子。性格同样是开朗活泼，由于丝毫不怕生，几乎与任何人都能很快熟识起来。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"75297"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"职业","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"75297","value":"农民（初期）"},{"label":"讨厌","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"75297","value":"谈论身高的话题"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5a/5ab2ff8a31094be54bb635e2e7d403f35b98448735152840f67fec5c64e948a6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/83/837132490602433df76d7673e5f05a3ca8b68e743af645a461d981b7fd5bd2be.webp","width":181,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"下屋則子","creatorId":"vndb:s71","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s71","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s71","name":"下屋則子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41268:75297:4471:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_75300","characterName":"巴尔迪鲁","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"75300","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"249447"},{"characterId":"75300","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41268"}]},"originalCharacterName":"巴尔迪鲁","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0516"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"171"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"62"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"薇欧蕾特的兄长兼保护者。因时时怠工不做农活外出冒险而常与妹妹拌嘴。胡萝卜村的第一战士（应该罗得弗利德才是最强嘛），是ロードフリード（罗得弗利德）儿时的玩伴，有些羡慕罗得弗利德。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"75300"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"职业","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"75300","value":"农民"},{"label":"讨厌","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"75300","value":"做农活"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c2/c28b13cbe27feeba8f2bc2205a0dc738f6d3fd1147f87d6546c558ee3627405c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dc845cf39bb4b11fa26841706476ff61df360423556754e54f12c946ade722ba.webp","width":176,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"金丸淳一","creatorId":"egs:creator:8152","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:8152","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:8152","name":"金丸淳一","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41268:75300:4629:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_75301","characterName":"Rodfried Santar","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"75301","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41268"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Rodfried Santar","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0727"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"179"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"65"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"帕鲁托罗的好朋友，出身富贵家庭，12岁时进入首都ハーフェン（海芬）的骑士精炼所进行特别训练，拥有出色的战斗特技。因喜欢田园生活而回到农村，在女孩子中很有人气，对薇欧蕾特比较在意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"简介来自："}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"75301"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"讨厌","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"75301","value":"城市的贵族"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fd1885b4dd96d689cc737bd7f250a1c3e29aa8d7f28bf92a8047db523777b89f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f8/f87f4666781a484a86a2fcf5aaf5136b5a5d9ac3c14367778c9e2f6d34ba6f30.webp","width":176,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"加藤木賢志","creatorId":"vndb:s16174","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s16174","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s16174","name":"加藤木 賢志","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41268:75301:4395:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_75302","characterName":"Brigitt Sihern","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"75302","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41268"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Brigitt Sihern","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0301"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"16000"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"48"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"由首都海芬搬迁至胡萝卜村近郊别墅的女孩子。个性好强家庭富裕，喜爱都市生活对胡萝卜村全无兴趣，只是想要在卡洛迪村治好病后再搬回首都。爱慕在胡萝卜村遇到的罗得弗利德，把薇欧蕾特视作绊脚石。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"75302"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"讨厌","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"75302","value":"薇欧蕾特"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/19/19347420e739d3bf319c545141c289abf79ca21fb828d7b8afee2548432f02f6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/97f1387a45f0e0c9343947980e50d673a906eefbe9ab6c05f09fbdeaec5d4836.webp","width":176,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"菊池志穂","creatorId":"vndb:s3638","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3638","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3638","name":"菊池志穂","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41268:75302:5280:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_75303","characterName":"Klara Barbier","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"75303","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41268"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Klara Barbier","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0919"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"159"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"45"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"卡洛迪村村长的孙女，虽然自幼娇生惯养体力贫弱，但却没有富家女孩那种娇蛮的性格，是个待人和气的普通女孩。在知道自己也成为这次让村子复兴比赛中的奖品之一的候补时曾经非常生气，不过在家人“能够让村子复兴的人一定非常有实力，说不定会是个很棒的人”的说词下才稍微冷静下来，现在最害怕的是“如果对象是个中年大叔的话那该怎办？”"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"75303"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"讨厌","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"75303","value":"蛇"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f0/f09bb9de60a437f818ae3f97d1dbfd9908ba7506396a9a264ebf69028cd67ba7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/31/31d0e6d0a0ef16ab2c5a6be00556bd9670bac631b1b53b23e4c788b8719484f0.webp","width":181,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_75304","characterName":"Eisel Weimar","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"75304","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"24106"},{"characterId":"75304","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41268"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Eisel Weimar","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"22"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0301"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"158"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"45"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"名字中的“Weimar”取自德国炼金术名城“魏玛”（Weimar）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最早登场于第二作《艾莉的工作室》，是个家境富有的千金大小姐，性格傲娇，视艾莉为竞争对手，但其实两人的关系很好，而且为人温柔大方，用国宝布做过洋娃娃送给街上的小孩子（主角：万恶的有钱人……）。暗恋着学习好又温柔的男同学诺迪斯，不过总是缺乏告白的勇气。在《薇欧蕾特的工作室》中再次登场，为了成为一流的炼金术士而在世界各地旅行修练。在旅行到卡洛迪村时，看到薇欧苦恼的样子，因此以自己的炼金术帮助薇欧渡过难关，之后还教导对炼金术产生兴趣的薇欧炼金术的基础。在听说“某个村子通过炼金术再度复兴”的传闻后，为了确认真相而再度回到卡洛迪村。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"75304"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"讨厌","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"75304","value":"很臭的东西"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/987dffd819c1e2dee1c2e1282e0bff26a0ea4a4270cf6a5b2a12989ad5c079c9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a795d7d5e547632563d543486e90c080bc954f73aae86c297f0c70f59f23a740.webp","width":181,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"飯塚雅弓","creatorId":"vndb:s1383","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1383","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1383","name":"飯塚 雅弓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41268:75304:3881:1","source":"bangumi"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p910","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:766","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p910","name":"ガスト","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:19291:766","source":"egs"}],"missingStates":["confirmed-character-relation-missing","current-runtime-cover-unavailable","vndb-work-mapping-pending"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
